{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Descent is a rogue-lite, action, wave-based survival game with some meta progression. You will make your way through waves of enemies until a boss spawns. Defeat that boss, and you can move on to the next level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Create your own builds</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different automatically used weapons to select from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Supports that change the way the weapons work and upgrade the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed abilities that you activate on command to get out of sticky situations or press the advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Battle deadly bosses</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each level, there is a boss to defeat in order to unlock the next level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Upgrade between runs</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using souls collected through your journey, upgrade yourself for the next and future runs.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733680?t=1751320660","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733680?t=1751320660","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733680/2e614a8841b7743db03641e96124f11c6a4325dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751320660","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733680/2e614a8841b7743db03641e96124f11c6a4325dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751320660","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"descripti